…the map constructor includes only the ·jvalue· and ignores the ·jkey·, such that the following query fails:

```xquery
let $jnode := { 'n': 123 }
return { $jnode/n }
```

Maybe we can tweak map constructors by generating single-entry maps from non-root JNodes?

```xquery
let $jnode := { 'n': 123 }
return { $jnode/n }
```

This would enable us to do many other things, such as filtering:

